Domain SpecialEducationDataModel
    documentation
"The Special Education Data Model represents key events in a student's special education journey. It captures IDEA-related events within an education organization and tracks associated Individualized Education Plans (IEPs), including the services provided, how they are delivered, and when they occur to support the student's educational goals."
    descriptor Accommodation
    descriptor EventCompliance
    descriptor EventReason
    domain entity IDEAEvent
    descriptor IDEAEvent
    descriptor IEPStatus
    descriptor ReasonExited
    descriptor SpecialEducationSetting
    domain entity StudentIEP